es with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int e^{y}\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x & =\\int - e^{- 2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ \\int e^{y}\\,\\mathrm{d}y & =\\int - e^{- 2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ e^{y} & =\\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\ne^{y}=\\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\ny=\\ln{\\left(C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nThe logarithm argument must be positive on the solution interval; $C$ is an arbitrary real constant." 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551631 1080 "y=C + \\frac{\\left(x + 4\\right)^{4}}{2}" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551631 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551631 1083 #uuid "cd687bcf-b772-5d76-b218-eacadbaa3087" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551632 1080 "y=\\pm \\sqrt{C - \\left(x + 4\\right)^{4}}" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551632 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551632 1083 #uuid "ce78f957-3274-584e-a365-02e56aa1f20a" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551633 1080 "y=\\sqrt[3]{C - \\left(x + 7\\right)^{2}}" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551633 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551633 1083 #uuid "ce90e750-d37b-538c-ba68-db863eb52201" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551634 1080 "y=C + \\frac{2 \\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{\\left(x - 3\\right)^{3}}}{3}" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551634 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551634 1083 #uuid "cfd48dc4-1af4-5e7f-b474-e8e828e55194" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551635 1080 "y=C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" 13194139535980 17592186045443 true] [17592186551635 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535980 1759218604544